# What tests/fixtures/android-system_dlkm.img holds, inode by inode, as
# two readers that are not this crate saw it (2026-09-30):
#   - the Linux 6.1 kernel's EROFS driver (Debian bookworm arm64), the
#     image loop-mounted read-only, walked with os.lstat / listxattr;
#   - fsck.erofs 1.5 --extract, which agreed on every path, type, size
#     and hash (it does not report modes, owners or xattrs).
# tests/oracle_android.rs builds the same lines with this crate's reader
# and compares. Fields, tab-separated: path, type (d/f/l), permission
# bits, uid:gid, size (- for a directory), SHA-256 of the data (of the
# target for a symlink; - for a directory), xattrs as name=hexvalue
# joined by commas (- for none). Sorted by path.
